## Testing and executable quality gates

Testing strategy: {{TESTING_STRATEGY}}

Configured executable gates are declared in `.buildos-policy.json` and run with
`project-lifecycle-bootstrap verify-gates`. Keep the set relevant to this
project; add build, type, regression, lint, packaging or scan commands only
when applicable.

Run validation as a coherent slice: inspect, implement, focused tests, fix
relevant failures, integrated relevant validation, and one final acceptance
pass. Persist detailed command output once, then retain a short summary and
pointer; use deterministic tooling for hashes, Git state, schema and evidence
existence. Re-run only after relevant change, failure, stale evidence, or the
required final clean pass.

