## Definition of Done

Implemented behavior, focused evidence, applicable regression, documentation
impact assessment, synchronized affected authorities, architecture impact
addressed, no unresolved required work, clean product target, deterministic
Build OS evidence, coherent continuity state, and Build OS close. Accepted
integration and deployment are later, separate events.

## Efficient handoff and closeout

Keep active work bounded to the objective, phase, constraints, touched files,
short decisions/validation summary, evidence pointers and next action. Read
only affected Knowledge Pack authorities after the documentation impact check.
Close with final validation, bounded evidence summaries/pointers, continuity and
documentation gates, then record/validate/close; do not reconstruct task
history unless deterministic checks report a mismatch.

